# Media & uploads

Media may be used for:
- profile pictures
- chat attachments
- voice practice
- learning materials

## Server-side requirements

Validate:
- authenticated owner/uploader
- MIME type
- extension
- file size
- upload purpose
- storage key ownership

Do not trust client-provided MIME types alone when the storage layer supports content inspection.

Use signed/private URLs for private media.

Never expose storage credentials to clients.

Do not allow arbitrary path/key input to become a storage path.

Apply retention/deletion rules to media associated with deleted users where required.
